Package: super-ircam
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6, libqt6widgets6, qt6-qpa-plugins, libopencv-core410, libopencv-imgproc410, libopencv-imgcodecs410, libopencv-videoio410
Maintainer: Sertac Tulluk <stulluk@gmail.com>
Description: Qt GUI for Qianli Super IRCam Pro 2S
 Button-based live viewer for USB thermal cameras that present as
 UVC 0bda:5830. Matches Thermal Camera Redux features: 37 colormaps,
 on-image min/max/center/user crosshairs, AVI recording, and live
 radiometric overlay. Auto-selects the infrared module.
